	["Skeletons keep rising around the circle during the fight. They are weak: kill them as they come."] = "Esqueletos continuam se erguendo ao redor do círculo durante a luta. São fracos: mate-os conforme aparecem.",
	["Skeletons rise and fight beside him. Kill them."] = "Esqueletos se erguem e lutam ao lado dele. Mate-os.",
